==Battleground==
*15 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*15 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*15 [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hatsune Miku XVI (Enemy)|Hatsune Miku XVI]] spawns as the boss.
**25 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 1.33~4 seconds<sup>40f~120f</sup>.
**35 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
**45 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

